      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/e274bd/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-15T17:38:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I believe the issue is cost of printing. They can sell the EE for what they do because they print them in such bulk. If they were to translate to German but make only a small run of them, each copy would be prohibitively expensive. So if you know any German game distributors, you should suggest they approach GTG about buying a few thousand at a time :)</p>",
